WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.211
(Intense music)

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:03.837
Brother Day:
This is an age of darkness.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.175
(Intense music)

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.762
Gaal Dornick:
I have dreams sometimes, about
things that will happen.

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:14.139
Gaal:
And I wake up terrified.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.601
(Beasts roaring)

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:25.859
(Intense music)

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:29.363
Gaal:
Despair, death, destruction.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:33.242
(Intense music)

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:35.994
Gaal:
This is even bigger than the
last crisis.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:40.749
(Intense music)

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:46.004
Brother Day:
An empire breathes respect. It
requires it for it's life.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.382
The Foundation is a
threat to me.

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:50.550
(Intense music)

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.680
Brother Day:
I will look at them in the eye,
and reclaim what is ours.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.224
(Intense music)

00:00:57.224 --> 00:00:59.893
For all of us to survive, we
have to face them.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.353
We need to be in the fight.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:04.064
(Thunder rumbles)

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:05.941
(Engines rumble)

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:15.284
(Intense music)

00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:16.493
Hari Seldon:
We fight for Peace.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:17.494
Show yourself!

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:21.039
(Intense music)

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:23.041
Hari:
Not because we fear we will
lose...

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:26.128
(Intense music)

00:01:26.128 --> 00:01:27.379
Hari:
...but because we know...

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:30.716
(Intense music)

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:32.384
Hari:
...that if there is war...

00:01:32.384 --> 00:01:33.844
Seldon!

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:37.848
(Intense music)

00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:38.849
...we will win.

00:01:38.849 --> 00:01:39.891
(Intense music)

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:40.892
(Beast roars)

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:41.935
(Day screaming)

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:46.898
(Intense music)

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.483
We are taking the planet!

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:54.698
(Intense music)

00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:57.617
It's time you and I had a
reckoning.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:12.632
(Music)

